            <p><strong>TF Aadhaar Cropper is NOT affiliated with UIDAI, the Government of India, or any official government agency.</strong> We are an independent, private utility tool designed to help users locally crop and format their e-Aadhaar PDFs for easier printing.</p>

            <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink mt-xl mb-xs">Data Privacy</h2>
